WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
The first person who stops and helps me change the tyre gets 200 euros.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.800
Quite a lot of cars have passed, but nobody has stopped yet.

3
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.700
Hopefully somebody will stop soon.

4
00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.140
Oh, it looks like somebody has stopped.

5
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.140
Do you happen to have this jack?

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.840
No, no, thanks.

7
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.980
That was also nice, that he stopped, but unfortunately he could not help me.

8
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.960
And now more waiting until somebody decides to help me.

9
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.080
And finally. Good day.

10
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.720
Do you have a jack?

11
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.100
I was coming from the restaurant. Do you work in a restaurant?

12
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.100
Thank you for stopping.

13
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.100
You are welcome, Luka.

14
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.100
Let me treat you.

15
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.100
This is help.

16
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.100
But this is gratitude for that help.

17
00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:10.860
And when I come to your restaurant for lunch, you will treat me, okay?

18
00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.540
And you are very positive and smiling.

19
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.100
Agreed.

20
00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:22.980
Thank you very much.
